== Description ==

'''Planks''' is a building material in ''[[Human Host]]'', crafted at the [[Carpentry Workbench]]. It appears as an ingredient in 26 downstream recipes at the [[Carpentry Workbench]], including [[Wood pillar]], [[Plank Wall]], [[Wooden Shield]], [[Plank Door Frame]], [[Small Plank Stairs]], [[Plank Stairs]], among others. See the ''Used in'' table for the full consumer list.

